    ('Cast Iron Manhole Cover', 'Look for heavy circular metal covers with raised rims and textured patterns, typically found in the middle of streets or sidewalks with their characteristic domed shape.', 'Detect a circular or near-circular metal cover set flush in street pavement with concentric ribs or radial patterns and a center handle or lug. Surface must show weathered gray cast iron texture.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Cast iron manhole covers weigh 90-300 pounds and their round shape prevents them from falling through the opening regardless of rotation angle.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/ee5491206c14b0c3.jpg', 0),
