    ('Thermal Manhole Cover', 'Look for square or circular metal covers with thermal insulation visible around the edges, typically found in urban areas with district heating systems.', 'Identify a circular metal plate set flush in pavement with concentric rings or specialized venting pattern and marking text indicating ''THERMAL'' or heat pipe system operator.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Thermal manhole covers in cold climates use thermal-break designs to prevent ground freezing and ice accumulation in underground utility passages.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/5f99c6bbb57edabb.gif', 4),
