    ('Sewer System Access Plate', 'Hunt for heavy metal covers marked with "S" or "SEWER," usually slightly sunken in the pavement, with raised rims to keep debris from entering.', 'Detect a circular metal plate set flush in street or alley bearing text ''SEWER'', ''SANITARY'', or municipal sewer authority markings with raised or recessed center.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Large sewer access covers are intentionally heavy to prevent child theft; they''re also occasionally stolen for scrap metal worth $5-50 per cover.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/be19daa67f91f1a1.jpg', 11),
