    ('Industrial Floor Grate', 'Search for sturdy metal grates with thick bars or diamond patterns, designed for heavy foot traffic and drainage, often found in loading areas or industrial zones.', 'Detect a rectangular or square metal grate recessed into industrial floor surface with open grid openings for drainage or ventilation in factory or warehouse setting.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Industrial floor grates use expanded metal or perforated steel with slip-resistant coatings engineered to meet OSHA safety standards for wet environments.', null, 14),
    ('Steam Vent Grate', 'Look for metal grates positioned on streets or building sides that may show signs of steam or heat damage, often with distinctive vent patterns and darker coloring.', 'Locate a metal grate or perforated plate at street level bearing text ''STEAM'' or ''VENT'' markings with visible slots or holes allowing steam/air release from underground system.', 'rare'::public.item_rarity, 'Steam vent grates in cities like New York can reach 260°F and their hexagonal perforations limit particle escape while allowing pressure release.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/1418efd28f0f7b2b.jpg', 15),
